                <mxCell id="58" value="&lt;font color='#000000'&gt;&lt;b&gt;② FAISS Search&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Encode each sub-query&lt;br&gt;→ [1×384] vector&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;index.search(vec,&lt;br&gt;  k = top_k × 5)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Merge + deduplicate&lt;br&gt;by chunk index&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=11;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="33">
